# Keep React frontend source lib directory tracked
!lov_frontend/opstronic-delight/src/lib/
!lov_frontend/opstronic-delight/src/lib/**

# Environment files — the bare `*.env` glob above does NOT match these, because
# it only matches names ENDING in .env. A backup like `.env.bak-20260907` or
# `.env.local` slipped straight past it and sat untracked in the repo root,
# one `git add .` away from publishing live credentials.
.env
.env.*
*.env.*
!.env.example
